== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Greylings|Aggressive creature strategies#Greyling}}

=== Attack ===
Swings their hand sideways in a 1.5-meter 90-degree horizontal arc to scratch the player (5 [[Damage types#Blunt|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 2 seconds when within 1.2 meters of a player.

== Notes ==
* Along with [[Neck]]s and [[Boar]]s, Greylings are one of the first enemies the player may encounter in ''[[Valheim]]''.
* 1-star and 2-star Greylings can only be spawned in using commands, and take on the appearance of the 1-star and 2-star Greydwarfs.

